Z||000000||Alex2004||06-11-2001||07:34 PM||||Today i got my 'Brain' back from bulldog and plugged it up and it works great now.  I already had the wiring installed from when i first got it, they said it had a bad resistor and they replaced it, it works great.  It wasn't that hard to install either.  You cannot tell it's even wired for an alarm.  The brain was really small, and i put it inbetweeen my radio and the black plastic thing.  I am going to attatch it to the black thing later today after i take my radio out, my LED is where most everyone else put's their's on the radio cover. It's a bulldog security system, model #1402, it was only $50 from JCwhitney.com, and it came in 3 days. it has alot of programmable options including ignition controlled door locks. Just thought i'd let you all know.<P>Alex...||||reg||10
